Kumusta, <%= @user.first_name %>!

Welcome to Pasabaya! Find a ride or share the spare seats in your car with people traveling your route. Pasabaya is free to use and takes no booking fees or commissions.

============================================================
GETTING STARTED
============================================================

1. Find a ride:
Search by route and departure date, choose a departure, and request a passenger seat. Your seat is confirmed when the driver accepts your request.

2. Coordinate your pickup:
After your request is accepted, use private trip chat to agree on pickup details with the driver and confirmed passengers.

3. Offer your spare seats:
Publish a one-time ride or a regular weekly schedule. Add your route, departure details, and passenger seats, then accept or decline incoming seat requests.

4. No matching ride yet?
Set an optional route alert from your search. You will receive a one-time email and in-app alert when a matching ride with available seats appears.

5. Your profile:
You can add an optional Facebook profile link to help other members learn more about you. A supplied link does not verify identity.

